canon init: wrote ./canon.yaml
canon init: skills.providers is [] — no canon skill installed; choose with `canon skills install --harness claude` (once for each of claude, codex, omp, pi) or `canon skills install --no-harness`
next: canon subject new <id> --domain <domain> --title "<title>" --actor <unit> --session <session> — no subject exists yet; a subject is the unit status, review and shipping track
